{"defaultLocale":"en-US","id":"TedZyzsdy.NegativeEncoder","installers":[{"architecture":"x64","dependencies":[],"elevation":{"requirement":"elevationRequired","source":"inferred"},"id":"x64-machine-nullsoft","priority":1,"scope":"machine","sha256":"3696f4acbf2d5b102c1862a93585deae3a29c191db7e329c1ab8a2db63bbf822","silent":{"arguments":"/S","source":"default"},"successCodes":[],"type":"nullsoft","uninstall":{"type":"productCode","value":"消极压制"},"upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://github.com/zyzsdy/NegativeEncoder/releases/download/v5.0.7/NegativeEncoderSetup_v5.0.7.exe"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/zyzsdy/NegativeEncoder/blob/main/LICENSE","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"description":"NegativeEncoder is a GUI tool for video encoding using QuickSync and NVENC.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/zyzsdy/NegativeEncoder/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"\"Negative encoding\" is an encoding method that saves system resources to the greatest extent and speeds up encoding. Sometimes video quality is not the main factor, so why not go \"negative\" instead of \"positively\" doing an elaborate encoding? This software calls hardware-accelerated encoding (e.g. NVENC), which is a very effective method. Although it is often said that the quality of the generated video is not as good as x264, it is sufficient in most cases, isn't it?","name":"消极压制","packageUrl":"https://github.com/zyzsdy/NegativeEncoder","publisher":"Ted Zyzsdy","publisherUrl":"https://zyzsdy.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/zyzsdy/NegativeEncoder/releases/tag/v5.0.7","tags":["encode","encoder","nvenc","quicksync","video"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"NegativeEncoder 是一款使用 QuickSync 和 NVENC 进行视频编码的图形界面工具。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/zyzsdy/NegativeEncoder/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"“消极压制”是指最大程度地节约系统资源，加快编码速度的一种压制方式。有时候视频质量并不是首要考虑因素，可以不用“积极地”进行一个精致的压制，何不“消极一把”呢？本软件调用硬件加速编码（例如 NVENC），这是一种十分有效的方式。虽然很多人说生成的质量不如 x